      </div>
      <p>Several decisions from the complete instrument have already been carried directly into the current modules: the cyclone liquid-sampling route, the 90° orthogonal arrangement of the COC optical windows, the PI film + PT100 + MAX31865 combination for temperature control, the 485 / 528 nm filter pair, the BPW34 + OPA350 + ADS1115 detection chain, and the KSD9700 hardware over-temperature protection.</p>
      <p>The table above is only a summary of the key figures of the complete instrument. The full equipment specification is a separate document with eight parts — scope, normative references, terms and definitions, technical requirements, test methods, inspection rules, marking and packaging, and notes — together with eight parameter tables.</p>
